{"4538110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nudge", "steam_appid": 4538110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nudge retrieve Crystals in this ARPG Tower Defense, where you collect loot, craft gear, unlock skills and fight waves of enemies in order to restore a girl's oppressed memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight waves of enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Nudge to defeat waves of enemies, while also placing towers in strategic positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find loot and craft gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger by finding a wide variety of loot, unique items or by crafting your own gear through Exile-like crafting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a wide variety of builds, by discovering new skills and fitting them into the unique Skill Grid mechanic, that grows with each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nudge retrieve Crystals in this ARPG Tower Defense, where you collect loot, craft gear, unlock skills and fight waves of enemies in order to restore a girl's oppressed memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight waves of enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Nudge to defeat waves of enemies, while also placing towers in strategic positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/4868c01e3a712eeaeebb1e69379532e3.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find loot and craft gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger by finding a wide variety of loot, unique items or by crafting your own gear through Exile-like crafting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/53121243f913df1e1b1023c0b8a9f754.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a wide variety of builds, by discovering new skills and fitting them into the unique Skill Grid mechanic, that grows with each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.poster.avif?t=1784103617\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.webm?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4538110/extras/a5868273dd6c9cc87708bc12abe3d271.mp4?t=1784103617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "